Value Filldown LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID_TYPE (.+?)
Value Required CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID_TYPE (.+?)
Value PORT_ID (.+?)
Value NEIGHBOR_NAME (.*?)
Value List SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION (.*?)
Value List MGMT_ADDRESS (\S+)

# One record per LLDP neighbour (LLDP agent block) under its local port header
# (campus-wan, vpn-fabric and VSR labs, Comware 7.1). The system description continues
# on lines indented further than the keys. A neighbour starts at its index or chassis
# type line. Other "key : value" lines are not modeled.
Start
  ^LLDP neighbor-information of port \d+\s*\[ -> Continue.Record
  ^LLDP neighbor-information of port \d+\s*\[${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\]:\s*$$
  ^LLDP agent \S+:\s*$$
  ^\s*LLDP neighbor index\s*: -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*LLDP neighbor index\s*:\s*\d+\s*$$
  ^\s*Chassis type\s*: -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*Chassis type\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_ID_TYPE}\s*$$
  ^\s*Chassis ID\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^\s*Port ID type\s*:\s*${PORT_ID_TYPE}\s*$$
  ^\s*Port ID\s*:\s*${PORT_ID}\s*$$
  ^\s*System name\s*:\s*${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$
  ^\s*System description\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION}\s*$$
  ^\s*Management address\s*:\s*${MGMT_ADDRESS}\s*$$
  ^\s{3,}${SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION}\s*$$
  ^\s*[A-Za-z][\w ()/.,-]*?\s*:(\s.*)?$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized display lldp neighbor-information line"
